[list]
[*]Fix: with Adaptive Storage - Global Settings, the floor borders disappeared from the Floors tab and from search, Dub's Mint Menus' included, once a storage building had been moved to another tab or hidden in its settings. Global Settings rebuilds every Architect tab when a game starts or loads, and Neat Edges' border buttons were not part of that rebuild. They are now registered with the Floors tab itself, so they come back with it, in the same places as before.
[*]For mod authors: a border another mod adds now joins the button for its shape on the Floors tab, whatever tab its def names. The README on GitHub has the details.
[*]Unchanged: Neat Edges still requires only Harmony, no defs changed, and nothing new is saved. Hard edges, areas and borders already in your saves load as they are and harden the same edges.
[/list]
